  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/6zYpqnrbZy\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yRY2Z3l.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"67\"></a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@dariphersmods\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Nrx7nR1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"67\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fboosty.to%252fdaripher%252fdonate\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/byUOqSi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"67\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>將<strong>Apotheosis</strong>和<strong>Curios API</strong>模組連接起來，允許任何飾品物品擁有<strong>Apotheosis</strong>的詞綴和插槽。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Apotheosis</strong>模組讓裝備物品具有不同的詞綴，例如「+生命值」、「+傷害」等。</p>\n<p>此系統類似於《暗黑破壞神》和《流放之路》等遊戲中的物品詞綴。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Curios API</strong>允許你添加新的物品槽位，例如戒指、項鍊等。</p>\n<p><br><br>然而，<strong>Apotheosis</strong>模組不會將這些新物品類型識別為裝備。</p>\n<p><strong>Apothic Curios</strong>模組修復了該問題，並允許模組包開發者將詞綴附加到飾品物品上。</p>\n<p><br><br>飾品的範例詞綴：<a href=\"https://github.com/Daripher/Apothic-Curios/tree/master/src/test/resources/data/apothiccurios/affixes/ring\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a></p>\n<p><br>與飾品配合使用的寶石範例：<a href=\"https://github.com/Daripher/Apothic-Curios/tree/master/src/test/resources/data/apotheosis/gems\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.19.2</a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/Daripher/Apothic-Curios/tree/1.20.1/src/test/resources/data/apotheosis/gems\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.20.1</a></p>",
